# Secret encryption

Encrypt with AES-256-GCM, random 12-byte IV, 16-byte tag, AAD bound to purpose
and key version. Decrypt only in process memory. Settings responses say
configured, never the key. Rotation re-encrypts secrets in bounded batches.
`RIDDLR_ENCRYPTION_MASTER_KEY_PREVIOUS` is tried after the current master key.
